---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ImportWizard from "../islands/ImportWizard";

Astro.response.headers.set("Cache-Control", "private, no-store");
---
<Base title="Publish a tool or guide" description="Import a GitHub or GitLab repository into the OTInstaller Registry.">
  <h1>Publish a tool or guide</h1>
  <p class="muted">Pick a repository: the registry detects what it is, drafts <code>otinstaller.yaml</code>, and opens a pull or merge request. Merging it and tagging <code>vX.Y.Z</code> publishes. Prefer the terminal? <code>ot import &lt;repository URL&gt;</code> does the same.</p>
  <ImportWizard client:load back={`${Astro.site}import`} />
</Base>
